  /Alt (A partial table displaying colour palette attributes. The column headers are not visible in the provided image snippet. The table lists three rows of data. * **Row 1**: Code 65531, followed by two empty cells, then repeated Code 65531, with RGB values R=100, G=100, B=100, represented by a dark grey colour swatch. * **Row 2**: Code 65532, followed by two empty cells, then repeated Code 65532, with RGB values R=75, G=75, B=75, represented by a dark grey colour swatch. * **Row 3**: Code 65533, followed by two empty cells, then repeated Code 65533, with RGB values R=126, G=52, B=107, represented by a purple colour swatch. | Code 1 | [unreadable/missing header] | [unreadable/missing header] | Code 2 | R | G | B | Colour Sample | |---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---| | 65531 | | | 65531 | 100 | 100 | 100 | Dark Grey | | 65532 | | | 65532 | 75 | 75 | 75 | Dark Grey | | 65533 | | | 65533 | 126 | 52 | 107 | Purple | This table provides integer codes and corresponding RGB colour values for specific entries in a Copernicus Land Monitoring Service (CLMS) High Resolution Layer (HRL) Croplands product, identified as 'C' [partial] layer in the context. The first two entries (65531 and 65532) share similar dark grey colours with slightly different RGB values, while the third entry (65533) is distinctly purple.)
